        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Through the Nest</strong> is a fast-paced top-down sci-fi roguelite shooter that throws you into deadly alien hives.<br>Each hive you clear leads to another filled with tougher, more dangerous enemies. Every run challenges you with new surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Class System</strong>: Begin with 2 playable classes. Earn <i>chips</i> through gameplay to unlock new ones and experiment with different playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧬 <strong>Roguelite Loop</strong>: Play, earn <i>chips</i>, die, grow, and try again. Permanent progression ensures that every run brings you closer to strength.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Run-Based Upgrades</strong>: Level up and choose powerful upgrades. Every decision shapes your strategy and makes each run unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👾 <strong>Challenging Hive System</strong>: Clearing one hive pushes you into the next, where deadlier enemies and fiercer battles await.</p></li></ul>",
